---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const LINKEDIN_URL = 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/xuenanwang/';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — She Leaves Notes">
  <section class="container-narrow pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-24">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-6">About</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl mb-10">
      I'm <span class="italic">Xuenan</span>.
    </h1>

    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-stone">
      <p>
        (she/her/hers) — I live in the Bay Area, work in tech, and write travel
        notes here.
      </p>
      <p>
        Monday through Friday I'm at a screen. Weekends, I'm somewhere outside —
        forest, hot spring, snorkel trip, deer cabin, whatever pulls me out of
        the chair.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is where the travel notes live. What to eat, where to stay,
        how to get there, whether I'd go back. They're in English, properly
        indexed, away from any algorithm.
      </p>
      <p>
        The name comes from my nickname <em>树叶</em> — which means "leaves" —
        and from what the site does: leaves notes behind, one trip at a time.
      </p>

      <h2>A few things I believe</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>In an AI-saturated world, the most precious thing is connection
          to the actual one.</strong> Most of why this site exists. Most of why
          I keep traveling.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Small animals are the cutest things on the planet.</strong> I
          have a cat named <strong>Xiaohei</strong> (<em>小黑</em>, "Little
          Black") who is non-negotiable evidence of this.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Weekends are for playing hard outdoors.</strong> Recharging
          isn't a luxury.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        If any of that resonates, I love a coffee chat — reach me on LinkedIn.
      </p>

      <p>
        Photos here are mine unless noted. Prices shift fast — check before you
        go.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12">
      <a
        href={LINKEDIN_URL}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-line rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-line/40 transition"
      >
        Find me on LinkedIn
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
